{"id":"n1-212","title":"～と言わんばかりの Noun (～to iwan bakari no Noun)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses the concept of 'as if to say'; 'almost says'; 'suggests'.","longExplanation":"The ～と言わんばかりの Noun grammar point is used to express that someone's action or a situation suggests a certain message, even though it is not explicitly said. It can be translated as 'as if to say', 'almost says', or 'suggests'. It is typically used to convey an unspoken message through someone's demeanor or behavior.","formation":"Verb-plain form + と言わんばかりの Noun","examples":[{"jp":"田中さんは嬉しくて飛び上がると言わんばかりの笑顔を見せた。","romaji":"Tanaka-san wa ureshikute tobiagaru to iwan bakari no egao wo miseta.","en":"Tanaka showed a smile as if to say he was so happy he could jump for joy.","words":[{"surface":"田中","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さん","vocabId":"1579350","reading":"さん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"嬉しく","vocabId":"1219510","reading":"うれしい","baseForm":"嬉しい"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"飛び上がる","vocabId":"1429690","reading":"とびあがる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言わ","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう","baseForm":"言う"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ばかり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"笑顔","vocabId":"1351400","reading":"えがお"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見せ","vocabId":"1259210","reading":"みせる","baseForm":"見せる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7,8,9,10]},{"jp":"彼女は僕に話しかけると言わんばかりの視線を送った。","romaji":"Kanojo wa boku ni hanashikakeru to iwan bakari no shisen wo okutta.","en":"She sent me glances as if to say she wanted to speak with me.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"僕","vocabId":"1521400","reading":"ぼく"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"話しかける","vocabId":"1562300","reading":"はなしかける"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言わ","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう","baseForm":"言う"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ばかり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"視線","vocabId":"1312060","reading":"しせん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"送っ","vocabId":"1402730","reading":"おくる","baseForm":"送る"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,7,8,9]},{"jp":"その老人は寒さで震えていると言わんばかりの姿を見せていた。","romaji":"Sono roujin wa samusa de furueteiru to iwan bakari no sugata wo miseteita.","en":"The old man was shivering as if to say he was freezing from the cold.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"老人","vocabId":"1561090","reading":"ろうじん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"寒","vocabId":"1955940","reading":"かん","baseForm":"寒い"},{"surface":"さ","vocabId":"1291070","reading":"さ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"震え","vocabId":"1366300","reading":"ふるえ","baseForm":"震える"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言わ","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう","baseForm":"言う"},{"surface":"ん","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ばかり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"姿","vocabId":"1307710","reading":"すがた"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"見せ","vocabId":"1259210","reading":"みせる","baseForm":"見せる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[9,10,11,12,13]},{"jp":"彼の体は緊張で固まっていると言わんばかりの風格を放っている。","romaji":"Kare no karada wa kinchou de katamatteiru to iwan bakari no fuukaku wo hanatteiru.","en":"He exudes an air as if his body were stiff from tension.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"体","vocabId":"1409140","reading":"からだ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"緊張","vocabId":"1241880","reading":"きんちょう"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"固まっ